[ceiling] The axial end faces of the fitted ASSE cavity capture its inlet adapter and both wrench shoulders. The production plate reaches the transition through the open passage with its dense interface.
alternatives: Extending the larger cavity through these ends removes axial capture. Ramping into the passage consumes the threaded-joint travel.
file: hardware/printed-parts/enclosure/rear-equipment-caps/asse-snap-cap.step
