[ceiling] The channel closes across the ASSE vent and drain-sleeve windows at the fitted end stations. The opening provides screwdriver access to remove the dense interface before fitting the sleeve.
alternatives: Closing these windows sooner would enter the sleeve at an allowed thread position. Lengthening the windows would remove adapter-shoulder stock.
file: hardware/printed-parts/enclosure/rear-equipment-caps/asse-snap-cap.step
